{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A Chaotic 2D Multiplayer Platformer Where Ninjas and Ghosts Battle for Supremacy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One ninja. One ghost. Endless chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In SoulBound, two players face off in a fast-paced, asymmetrical duel:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Ninja must dash, wall-jump, and evade their way through a randomly generated level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Ghost can possess and control enemies to ambush, trap, and crush the ninja.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When the ninja falls, roles swap\u2014and the player who travels the farthest as the ninja wins.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Why It\u2019s Addictive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39 Asymmetrical Mayhem: One player\u2019s precision platforming vs. the other\u2019s tactical possession.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39 Endless Replayability: Randomly generated levels + unpredictable enemy control = no two matches alike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39 Pixel Art Throwdown: Vibrant, retro-inspired visuals amp up the frenetic energy.<br>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A Game by Schmoovin Studios </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Peter Cheshire </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Harrison Clarke </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Samuel Myatt </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Paul Haynes </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Kacper Nowak  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Music by Jakealtmann  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cover art by Notperera</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2093060?t=1746786530","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2093060?t=1746786530","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093060/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746786530","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093060/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746786530","categories":[{"description"